  telemetry                   → view.opened surface="TeslaAuthCard" via TeslaAuthCardSurface.reportOpen (P1/S11),
                                default redaction-safe OSLog sink, emitted from the view's .task.

STATES (every web branch reproduced — pure presentational, so no data loading/error/stale/offline owned here)
  ok           → green bar, checkmark shield, "Connected" badge, "Token expires in N days." , "Manage".
  warn (<=7d)  → amber bar, alert shield, "Expires soon" badge, "Token expires in N days/1 day/later today.".
  expired      → red bar, x shield, "Token expired" badge, "Expired today / Nd ago — …" , "Re-authenticate".
  disconnected → red bar, x shield, "Not connected" badge, "No Tesla account is currently connected.",
                 "Re-authenticate".  (friendly "offline/empty" surface — never a blank box.)
  unknown      → neutral bar, alert shield, "Unknown" badge, "Token expiry unknown/unparseable …".
                 (friendly "awaiting data" surface.)

